t\n    45→- heater (optional but supported)\n    46→- light\n    47→- rooted plants\n    48→- periphyton / biofilm\n    49→- free algae\n    50→- microbial guilds\n    51→- microfauna guilds\n    52→- shrimp population\n    53→- detritus / dissolved organics\n    54→- player maintenance actions\n    55→\n    56→## 2.2 Out of scope for v1\n    57→\n    58→- photorealistic graphics\n...\n</persisted-output>"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01N1Z9PEPcr3ARbXJjzcPA1Q","session_id":"5afc8472-1402-44b3-9d7c-1a241eb51364","uuid":"2dbd65a1-789b-4758-b1fa-cbfbefb1d90b"}
