{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_013N7r8xaLrPv4e9tCPspnS5","type":"tool_result","content":"   970→\n   971→```rust\n   972→pub enum PlayerAction {\n   973→    Feed { grams: f32 },\n   974→    WaterChangePercent { percent: f32, source: SourceWaterProfile },\n   975→    TopOffEvaporation { liters: f32, source: SourceWaterProfile },\n   976→    DoseFertilizer { n_mg: f32, p_mg: f32, k_mg: f32 },\n   977→    TrimPlants { fraction: f32 },\n   978→    SiphonDetritus { fraction: f32 },\n   979→    CleanFilter { intensity: f32 },\n   980→    AddShrimp { count: u32 },\n   981→    RemoveShrimp { count: u32 },\n   982→    ChangePhotoperiod { hours: f32 },\n   983→    ChangeLightIntensity { intensity_index: f32 },\n   984→    ChangeHeaterSetpoint { setpoint_c: f32 },\n   985→    ChangeAmbientTemperature { target_c: f32 },\n   986→    ChangeAeration { enabled: bool, intensity: f32 },\n   987→}\n   988→```\n   989→\n   990→### Important requirement\n   991→`ChangeAmbientTemperature` is mandatory in the public API.\n   992→\n   993→## 11.3 Action semantics\n   994→\n   995→### Feed\n   996→- adds particulate organics\n   997→- increases later detritus and excretion\n   998→- increases food availability\n   999→- may improve reproduction if not excessive\n  1000→\n  1001→### Water change\n  1002→- removes dissolved and suspended constituents proportionally\n  1003→- mixes in source water temperature and chemistry\n  1004→- can cause stress if parameters differ strongly\n  1005→\n  1006→### Top-off\n  1007→- restores volume but usually does not remove dissolved waste\n  1008→- depending on source chemistry, can alter TDS/KH/GH\n  1009→\n  1010→### Clean filter\n  1011→- reduces clogging\n  1012→- may remove nitrifier biomass if too aggressive\n  1013→\n  1014→### Change ambient temperature\n  1015→- changes room environment, not instant water temperature\n  1016→- effect propagates through heat transfer over time\n  1017→\n  1018→---\n  1019→\n  1020→## 12. Update order per tick\n  1021→\n  1022→The order must be explicit and stable.\n  1023→\n  1024→Recommended hourly update pipeline:\n  1025→\n  1026→1. apply scheduled environment updates\n  1027→2. apply queued player actions\n  1028→3. update water volume (evaporation/top-off/water change)\n  1029→4. update temperature from ambient + heater + equipment\n  1030→5. update light state for current hour\n  1031→6. compute gas solubility targets from temperature\n  1032→7. process feeding/excretion pulses\n  1033→8. move detritus through decomposition/mineralization\n  1034→9. update nitrification\n  1035→10. update carbon/oxygen exchange\n  1036→11. update plant photosynthesis/respiration\n  1037→12. update algae/periphyton photosynthesis/respiration\n  1038→13. update pH / alkalinity / NH3 fraction\n  1039→14. update shrimp feeding/stress\n  1040→15. accumulate daily summaries\n  1041→16. emit events / warnings / observations\n  1042→17. recompute observables\n  1043→\n  1044→Daily update pipeline:\n  1045→\n  1046→1. plant biomass growth/senescence\n  1047→2. algae net biomass changes\n  1048→3. microfauna turnover\n  1049→4. shrimp reproduction and juvenile recruitment"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_013yHGd5uFJHJgdiXSiSjdyf","session_id":"5afc8472-1402-44b3-9d7c-1a241eb51364","uuid":"59340e42-af5a-4469-9528-fa26d688cb62"}
