ae, periphyton, nuisance index, detritus pools)\n  - Shrimp population (counts by stage, condition, molt stress, readiness)\n  - Biofilter maturity (AOB, NOB, comammox, decomposer biomass)\n  - Microfauna summary (population index, grazing pressure, filter cleanliness)\n\n- **Actions** (`actions.rs`) - Action form system with 12 action types\n\n- **Log** (`log.rs`) - Renders:\n  - Recent events chronologically\n  - Event severity color-coding (info/warning/critical)\n  - Event kind, day, hour, summary, and cause codes\n\n---\n\n### 2. REQUIRED CONTROLS - ALL PRESENT ✓\n\n**Time controls** (implemented in `input.rs` and `lib.rs`):\n- `h` - Step 1 hour ✓\n- `d` - Step 1 day (24 hours) ✓\n- `w` - Step 1 week (168 hours) ✓\n- `space` - Toggle auto-advance/pause ✓\n\n**Navigation controls** (implemented in `input.rs` and `lib.rs`):\n- `Tab` - Cycle next screen ✓\n- `1-5` - Jump to specific screen (Overview, Chemistry, Biology, Actions, Log) ✓\n- `q` - Quit ✓\n\n**Save/Load controls** (implemented in `input.rs` and `lib.rs`):\n- `s` - Save to disk (calls `save_to_disk()` which serializes engine state to JSON) ✓\n- `l` - Load from disk (calls `load_from_disk()` which deserializes SaveFile and rebuilds engine) ✓\n\n**Actions screen controls** (implemented in `input.rs`):\n- `Up/Down` - Navigate between actions\n- `Left/Right` - Navigate between fields\n- `[/]` - Cycle choice fields (source water selection)\n- `t` - Toggle boolean fields (aeration enabled)\n- `Backspace` - Delete from numeric field\n- `0-9 and .` - Edit numeric fields\n- `Enter` - Submit action\n\n---\n\n### 3. STATE MANAGEMENT - CLEAN ARCHITECTURE ✓\n\n**TUI uses ONLY TankSnapshot and PlayerAction dispatch - verified:**\n\nLocated in: `/root/tank-simulation/crates/tank_tui/src/lib.rs`\n\n- **Engine encapsulation**: Core state stored in `self.engine: Engine`\n- **Snapshot-based rendering**: All screens read from `&app.snapshot: TankSnapshot` (immutable borrows)\n- **Action dispatch**: `app.apply_action(actio