{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01N1Z9PEPcr3ARbXJjzcPA1Q","type":"tool_result","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Perfect! Now I have gathered comprehensive information. Let me create a thorough verification report:\n\n## Comprehensive Simulation System Verification Report\n\nI have conducted a thorough search of the `/root/tank-simulation` codebase and verified the presence and correctness of all 12 required simulation systems. Here is the detailed verification:\n\n---\n\n### 1. **TEMPERATURE SYSTEM** ✓\n**File:** `/root/tank-simulation/crates/tank_core/src/systems/temperature.rs`\n\n**Formula verification:**\n- `heat_capacity_j_per_k = volume_l * 4186.0` ✓ (line 39)\n- `ua_total_w_per_k = (k_surface * surface_area_m2 * top_factor) + (k_wall * wall_area_m2)` ✓ (line 48)\n- `q_ambient_w = ua_total_w_per_k * (ambient_temp_c - water_temp_c)` ✓ (line 53)\n- `q_heater_w` with deadband: enabled when `water_temp_c < (setpoint_c - deadband_c / 2.0)` ✓ (lines 56-63)\n- DO saturation table interpolation: `(0C→14.6, 10C→11.3, 20C→9.1, 30C→7.6)` ✓ (lines 5-26)\n\n---\n\n### 2. **NITROGEN CYCLE** ✓\n**File:** `/root/tank-simulation/crates/tank_core/src/systems/nitrogen_cycle.rs`\n\n**Pathway verification:**\n- Feed leaching: particulate organics → fine detritus (line 46-52)\n- Mineralization: DOC/DON → TAN via decomposer guild (lines 72-117)\n- Nitrification pathway:\n  - AOB: TAN → nitrite (lines 135-156)\n  - Comammox: TAN → nitrate directly (lines 164-190)\n  - NOB: nitrite → nitrate (lines 211-239)\n- Monod-style kinetics: `monod_rate = vmax * biomass * environmental_factor * S/(K+S)` ✓ (lines 332-342)\n- Environmental factors: temperature_factor, pH_factor, maturity, dirty_filter, flow (lines 283-330)\n- Alkalinity consumption: `0.1428 meq per mg N nitrified` ✓ (`/root/tank-simulation/crates/tank_core/src/types/process.rs` line 163)\n\n---\n\n### 3. **AMMONIA SPECIATION** ✓\n**File:** `/root/tank-simulation/crates/tank_core/src/systems/chemistry.rs`\n\n**Formula verification:**\n- `pKa = 0.09018 + 2729.92 / (273.2 + temp_c)` ✓ (line 24)\n- `fraction_nh3 = 1.0 / (1.0 + 10.0^(pKa - pH))` ✓ (line 25)\n- `nh3_mg_l = tan_mg_l * fraction_nh3` ✓ (line 26)\n\n---\n\n### 4. **DISSOLVED OXYGEN** ✓\n**File:** `/root/tank-simulation/crates/tank_core/src/systems/dissolved_oxygen.rs`\n\n**Formula verification:**\n- `do_sat_mg_l(temp_c)` interpolation table lookup ✓ (line 15)\n- Reaeration: `delta_do_reaeration_mg = k_la * (do_sat_mg_l - do_mg_l) * volume_l` ✓ (line 30)\n- k_la calculation includes: base reaeration, aeration intensity boost, filter boost (lines 22-29)\n- Photosynthesis: `photosynthetic_o2_mg = rate * photosynthetic_biomass * intensity_index * light_on` ✓ (lines 36-44)\n- Respiration: `background_bod_mg = rate * respiring_biomass` ✓ (lines 32-35)\n\n---\n\n### 5. **pH AND ALKALINITY** ✓\n**File:** `/root/tank-simulation/crates/tank_core/src/systems/chemistry.rs`\n\n**Formula verification:**\n- pH calculation: `ph = clamp(6.3 + log10(alkalinity) - log10(dic), 5.5, 8.5)` ✓ (lines 19-20)\n- Alkalinity consumption from nitrification: `0.1428 meq per mg N` ✓ (process.rs line 163)\n- Applied in nitrogen cycle (lines 269-273 of nitrogen_cycle.rs)\n- Display KH formula: `kh_d = (alkalinity_meq_l * 50.0) / 17.848` ✓ (snapshot.rs line 80)\n\n---\n\n### 6. **SUBSTRATE SYSTEM** ✓\n**File:** `/root/tank-simulation/crates/tank_core/src/types/substrate.rs`\n\n**Implementation verification:**\n- Three distinct layer architecture supported ✓\n- Substrate kinds implemented: InertSand, InertGravel, ActivePlanted, CoarsePorous ✓ (lines 4-8)\n- Per-layer attributes:\n  - Nutrient stores (N, P) ✓\n  - Cation exchange capacity index ✓\n  - Detritus trapping index ✓\n  - Colonizable area ✓\n  - Low oxygen tendency ✓\n  - Grazing surface index ✓\n\n---\n\n### 7. **PLANT GUILDS** ✓\n**File:** `/root/tank-simulation/crates/tank_core/src/types/biology.rs` and `/root/tank-simulation/crates/tank_core/src/systems/plant_growth.rs`\n\n**Guild implementation:**\n- **FastStem**: water-column bias 0.9, substrate bias 0.1 ✓ (biology.rs lines 217-218)\n- **RootFeedingRosette**: water-column bias 0.1, substrate bias 0.9 ✓ (biology.rs lines 217-218)\n- Bounded growth model: `gross_growth = biomass * max_rate * f_light * f_temp * nutrient_limitation * habitat_index * (1.0 - crowding_index)` ✓ (plant_growth.rs lines 61-67)\n- Crowding index calculation ✓ (plant_growth.rs lines 9-15)\n- Health tracking with stress/recovery mechanics ✓ (plant_growth.rs lines 87-94)\n\n---\n\n### 8. **ALGAE/PERIPHYTON** ✓\n**File:** `/root/tank-simulation/crates/tank_core/src/systems/algae_growth.rs`\n\n**Implementation verification:**\n- Suspended algae pool ✓ (lines 43-62)\n- Periphyton (biofilm) pool with capacity constraint ✓ (lines 64-98)\n- Light factor calculation ✓ (lines 116-126)\n- Plant shading interaction ✓ (lines 22-30)\n- Nutrient limitation (N, P) ✓ (lines 31-38)\n- Microfauna grazing ✓ (lines 39-41)\n- Nuisance index calculation ✓ (lines 100-111)\n\n---\n\n### 9. **DECOMPOSER/NITRIFIER GUILDS** ✓\n**File:** `/root/tank-simulation/crates/tank_core/src/types/biology.rs` and `/root/tank-simulation/crates/tank_core/src/systems/nitrogen_cycle.rs`\n\n**Guild implementation:**\n- Decomposer biomass tracking ✓ (biology.rs line 38)\n- Ammonia oxidizer (AOB) ✓ (biology.rs line 39)\n- Nitrite oxidizer (NOB) ✓ (biology.rs line 40)\n- Comammox (complete ammonia oxidizers) ✓ (biology.rs line 41)\n- Full kinetic implementation with Monod kinetics, growth, and decay ✓ (nitrogen_cycle.rs)\n\n---\n\n### 10. **MICROFAUNA** ✓\n**File:** `/root/tank-simulation/crates/tank_core/src/systems/microfauna.rs`\n\n**Implementation verification:**\n- Aggregate grazing index tracking ✓ (line 48)\n- Population index based on resource availability ✓ (lines 21-39)\n- Resource availability from detritus and periphyton ✓ (lines 21-26)\n- Shrimp grazing pressure penalty ✓ (lines 29-32)\n- Mineralization boost effect ✓ (applied in nitrogen_cycle.rs lines 84-85)\n- Periphyton and detritus consumption ✓ (lines 45-55)\n\n---\n\n### 11. **SHRIMP SYSTEM** ✓\n**File:** `/root/tank-simulation/crates/tank_core/src/systems/shrimp.rs`\n\n**Population tracking:**\n- Adults count ✓\n- Juveniles count ✓\n- Berried females count with egg cohorts ✓ (biology.rs lines 9-12, 55-56)\n- Condition index (0-1 scale) ✓ (line 150-203)\n- Molt stress index ✓ (lines 205-242)\n- Reproductive readiness index ✓ (lines 244-259)\n- Hourly stress accumulators: NH3, nitrite, low DO, heat, instability ✓ (lines 10-50)\n- Full lifecycle: spawning, egg development, juvenile recruitment, mortality ✓ (lines 58-82)\n\n---\n\n### 12. **DISPLAY FORMULAS** ✓\n**File:** `/root/tank-simulation/crates/tank_core/src/types/snapshot.rs`\n\n**Formula verification:**\n- `gh_d = ((2.497 * ca_mg_l) + (4.118 * mg_mg_l)) / 17.848` ✓ (line 79)\n- `kh_d = (alkalinity_meq_l * 50.0) / 17.848` ✓ (line 80)\n- `tds_mg_l = total_tracked_ions_mg / volume_l` ✓ (line 77)\n- `conductivity_us_cm = tds_mg_l / 0.65` ✓ (line 78)\n\n---\n\n## Summary\n\nAll 12 required simulation systems are implemented with scientifically grounded formulas and logic:\n\n| System | File Path | Status |\n|--------|-----------|--------|\n| 1. Temperature (ua_total, q_ambient, q_heater deadband, heat_capacity) | `/root/tank-simulation/crates/tank_core/src/systems/temperature.rs` | ✓ VERIFIED |\n| 2. Nitrogen Cycle (detritus→mineralization→TAN→NO₂→NO₃, Monod rates) | `/root/tank-simulation/crates/tank_core/src/systems/nitrogen_cycle.rs` | ✓ VERIFIED |\n| 3. Ammonia Speciation (pKa, fraction_NH3) | `/root/tank-simulation/crates/tank_core/src/systems/chemistry.rs` | ✓ VERIFIED |\n| 4. Dissolved Oxygen (saturation table, reaeration, photosynthesis/respiration) | `/root/tank-simulation/crates/tank_core/src/systems/dissolved_oxygen.rs` | ✓ VERIFIED |\n| 5. pH & Alkalinity (pH formula, 0.1428 meq/mg N consumption) | `/root/tank-simulation/crates/tank_core/src/systems/chemistry.rs` + process.rs | ✓ VERIFIED |\n| 6. Substrate (1-3 layers, InertSand/Gravel/ActivePlanted/CoarsePorous) | `/root/tank-simulation/crates/tank_core/src/types/substrate.rs` | ✓ VERIFIED |\n| 7. Plant Guilds (FastStem & RootFeedingRosette, bounded growth) | `/root/tank-simulation/crates/tank_core/src/systems/plant_growth.rs` | ✓ VERIFIED |\n| 8. Algae/Periphyton (suspended + periphyton pools, light/nutrient/shading) | `/root/tank-simulation/crates/tank_core/src/systems/algae_growth.rs` | ✓ VERIFIED |\n| 9. Decomposer/Nitrifier Guilds (AOB, NOB, comammox, Monod kinetics) | `/root/tank-simulation/crates/tank_core/src/systems/nitrogen_cycle.rs` | ✓ VERIFIED |\n| 10. Microfauna (grazing index, population dynamics) | `/root/tank-simulation/crates/tank_core/src/systems/microfauna.rs` | ✓ VERIFIED |\n| 11. Shrimp (adults/juveniles/berried females, condition/molt/reproductive traits) | `/root/tank-simulation/crates/tank_core/src/systems/shrimp.rs` | ✓ VERIFIED |\n| 12. Display Formulas (gh_d, kh_d, tds_mg_l, conductivity_us_cm) | `/root/tank-simulation/crates/tank_core/src/types/snapshot.rs` | ✓ VERIFIED |\n\nAll formulas match the specification with exact coefficient values and mathematical relationships confirmed."},{"type":"text","text":"agentId: aa0f1157a9c408927 (for resuming to continue this agent's work if needed)\n<usage>total_tokens: 70178\ntool_uses: 32\nduration_ms: 83639</usage>"}]}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"5afc8472-1402-44b3-9d7c-1a241eb51364","uuid":"2d43c7b3-96bf-4b03-88c9-bf2add567c21","tool_use_result":{"status":"completed","prompt":"In /root/tank-simulation, search very thoroughly for these required simulation systems. For each, find the implementing code and verify the key formulas/logic:\n\n1. Temperature system: ua_total calculation, q_ambient, q_heater with deadband, heat_capacity_j_per_k = volume_l * 4186.0\n2. Nitrogen cycle: detritus -> mineralization -> TAN -> nitrite -> nitrate pathway, Monod-style rates\n3. Ammonia speciation: pKa formula, fraction_nh3 calculation\n4. Dissolved oxygen: do_sat_mg_l interpolation table (0C->14.6, 10C->11.3, 20C->9.1, 30C->7.6), reaeration, photosynthesis/respiration\n5. pH and alkalinity: the specific formula ph = clamp(6.3 + log10(alkalinity) - log10(dic), 5.5, 8.5), alkalinity consumption from nitrification (0.1428 meq per mg N)\n6. Substrate: 1-3 layers, inert sand/gravel, active planted, coarse porous\n7. Plant guilds: FastStem and RootFeedingRosette with bounded growth model\n8. Algae/periphyton: suspended algae and periphyton pools\n9. Decomposer/nitrifier guilds: ammonia oxidizers, nitrite oxidizers, comammox\n10. Microfauna: aggregate grazing index\n11. Shrimp: adults, juveniles, berried females, condition, molt_stress, reproductive_readiness\n12. Display formulas: gh_d, kh_d, tds_mg_l, conductivity_us_cm\n\nReport file paths and confirm whether each formula matches the spec.","agentId":"aa0f1157a9c408927","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Perfect! Now I have gathered comprehensive information. Let me create a thorough verification report:\n\n## Comprehensive Simulation System Verification Report\n\nI have conducted a thorough search of the `/root/tank-simulation` codebase and verified the presence and correctness of all 12 required simulation systems. Here is the detailed verification:\n\n---\n\n### 1. **TEMPERATURE SYSTEM** ✓\n**File:** `/root/tank-simulation/crates/tank_core/src/systems/temperature.rs`\n\n**Formula verification:**\n- `heat_capacity_j_per_k = volume_l * 4186.0` ✓ (line 39)\n- `ua_total_w_per_k = (k_surface * surface_area_m2 * top_factor) + (k_wall * wall_area_m2)` ✓ (line 48)\n- `q_ambient_w = ua_total_w_per_k * (ambient_temp_c - water_temp_c)` ✓ (line 53)\n- `q_heater_w` with deadband: enabled when `water_temp_c < (setpoint_c - deadband_c / 2.0)` ✓ (lines 56-63)\n- DO saturation table interpolation: `(0C→14.6, 10C→11.3, 20C→9.1, 30C→7.6)` ✓ (lines 5-26)\n\n---\n\n### 2. **NITROGEN CYCLE** ✓\n**File:** `/root/tank-simulation/crates/tank_core/src/systems/nitrogen_cycle.rs`\n\n**Pathway verification:**\n- Feed leaching: particulate organics → fine detritus (line 46-52)\n- Mineralization: DOC/DON → TAN via decomposer guild (lines 72-117)\n- Nitrification pathway:\n  - AOB: TAN → nitrite (lines 135-156)\n  - Comammox: TAN → nitrate directly (lines 164-190)\n  - NOB: nitrite → nitrate (lines 211-239)\n- Monod-style kinetics: `monod_rate = vmax * biomass * environmental_factor * S/(K+S)` ✓ (lines 332-342)\n- Environmental factors: temperature_factor, pH_factor, maturity, dirty_filter, flow (lines 283-330)\n- Alkalinity consumption: `0.1428 meq per mg N nitrified` ✓ (`/root/tank-simulation/crates/tank_core/src/types/process.rs` line 163)\n\n---\n\n### 3. **AMMONIA SPECIATION** ✓\n**File:** `/root/tank-simulation/crates/tank_core/src/systems/chemistry.rs`\n\n**Formula verification:**\n- `pKa = 0.09018 + 2729.92 / (273.2 + temp_c)` ✓ (line 24)\n- `fraction_nh3 = 1.0 / (1.0 + 10.0^(pKa - pH))` ✓ (line 25)\n- `nh3_mg_l = tan_mg_l * fraction_nh3` ✓ (line 26)\n\n---\n\n### 4. **DISSOLVED OXYGEN** ✓\n**File:** `/root/tank-simulation/crates/tank_core/src/systems/dissolved_oxygen.rs`\n\n**Formula verification:**\n- `do_sat_mg_l(temp_c)` interpolation table lookup ✓ (line 15)\n- Reaeration: `delta_do_reaeration_mg = k_la * (do_sat_mg_l - do_mg_l) * volume_l` ✓ (line 30)\n- k_la calculation includes: base reaeration, aeration intensity boost, filter boost (lines 22-29)\n- Photosynthesis: `photosynthetic_o2_mg = rate * photosynthetic_biomass * intensity_index * light_on` ✓ (lines 36-44)\n- Respiration: `background_bod_mg = rate * respiring_biomass` ✓ (lines 32-35)\n\n---\n\n### 5. **pH AND ALKALINITY** ✓\n**File:** `/root/tank-simulation/crates/tank_core/src/systems/chemistry.rs`\n\n**Formula verification:**\n- pH calculation: `ph = clamp(6.3 + log10(alkalinity) - log10(dic), 5.5, 8.5)` ✓ (lines 19-20)\n- Alkalinity consumption from nitrification: `0.1428 meq per mg N` ✓ (process.rs line 163)\n- Applied in nitrogen cycle (lines 269-273 of nitrogen_cycle.rs)\n- Display KH formula: `kh_d = (alkalinity_meq_l * 50.0) / 17.848` ✓ (snapshot.rs line 80)\n\n---\n\n### 6. **SUBSTRATE SYSTEM** ✓\n**File:** `/root/tank-simulation/crates/tank_core/src/types/substrate.rs`\n\n**Implementation verification:**\n- Three distinct layer architecture supported ✓\n- Substrate kinds implemented: InertSand, InertGravel, ActivePlanted, CoarsePorous ✓ (lines 4-8)\n- Per-layer attributes:\n  - Nutrient stores (N, P) ✓\n  - Cation exchange capacity index ✓\n  - Detritus trapping index ✓\n  - Colonizable area ✓\n  - Low oxygen tendency ✓\n  - Grazing surface index ✓\n\n---\n\n### 7. **PLANT GUILDS** ✓\n**File:** `/root/tank-simulation/crates/tank_core/src/types/biology.rs` and `/root/tank-simulation/crates/tank_core/src/systems/plant_growth.rs`\n\n**Guild implementation:**\n- **FastStem**: water-column bias 0.9, substrate bias 0.1 ✓ (biology.rs lines 217-218)\n- **RootFeedingRosette**: water-column bias 0.1, substrate bias 0.9 ✓ (biology.rs lines 217-218)\n- Bounded growth model: `gross_growth = biomass * max_rate * f_light * f_temp * nutrient_limitation * habitat_index * (1.0 - crowding_index)` ✓ (plant_growth.rs lines 61-67)\n- Crowding index calculation ✓ (plant_growth.rs lines 9-15)\n- Health tracking with stress/recovery mechanics ✓ (plant_growth.rs lines 87-94)\n\n---\n\n### 8. **ALGAE/PERIPHYTON** ✓\n**File:** `/root/tank-simulation/crates/tank_core/src/systems/algae_growth.rs`\n\n**Implementation verification:**\n- Suspended algae pool ✓ (lines 43-62)\n- Periphyton (biofilm) pool with capacity constraint ✓ (lines 64-98)\n- Light factor calculation ✓ (lines 116-126)\n- Plant shading interaction ✓ (lines 22-30)\n- Nutrient limitation (N, P) ✓ (lines 31-38)\n- Microfauna grazing ✓ (lines 39-41)\n- Nuisance index calculation ✓ (lines 100-111)\n\n---\n\n### 9. **DECOMPOSER/NITRIFIER GUILDS** ✓\n**File:** `/root/tank-simulation/crates/tank_core/src/types/biology.rs` and `/root/tank-simulation/crates/tank_core/src/systems/nitrogen_cycle.rs`\n\n**Guild implementation:**\n- Decomposer biomass tracking ✓ (biology.rs line 38)\n- Ammonia oxidizer (AOB) ✓ (biology.rs line 39)\n- Nitrite oxidizer (NOB) ✓ (biology.rs line 40)\n- Comammox (complete ammonia oxidizers) ✓ (biology.rs line 41)\n- Full kinetic implementation with Monod kinetics, growth, and decay ✓ (nitrogen_cycle.rs)\n\n---\n\n### 10. **MICROFAUNA** ✓\n**File:** `/root/tank-simulation/crates/tank_core/src/systems/microfauna.rs`\n\n**Implementation verification:**\n- Aggregate grazing index tracking ✓ (line 48)\n- Population index based on resource availability ✓ (lines 21-39)\n- Resource availability from detritus and periphyton ✓ (lines 21-26)\n- Shrimp grazing pressure penalty ✓ (lines 29-32)\n- Mineralization boost effect ✓ (applied in nitrogen_cycle.rs lines 84-85)\n- Periphyton and detritus consumption ✓ (lines 45-55)\n\n---\n\n### 11. **SHRIMP SYSTEM** ✓\n**File:** `/root/tank-simulation/crates/tank_core/src/systems/shrimp.rs`\n\n**Population tracking:**\n- Adults count ✓\n- Juveniles count ✓\n- Berried females count with egg cohorts ✓ (biology.rs lines 9-12, 55-56)\n- Condition index (0-1 scale) ✓ (line 150-203)\n- Molt stress index ✓ (lines 205-242)\n- Reproductive readiness index ✓ (lines 244-259)\n- Hourly stress accumulators: NH3, nitrite, low DO, heat, instability ✓ (lines 10-50)\n- Full lifecycle: spawning, egg development, juvenile recruitment, mortality ✓ (lines 58-82)\n\n---\n\n### 12. **DISPLAY FORMULAS** ✓\n**File:** `/root/tank-simulation/crates/tank_core/src/types/snapshot.rs`\n\n**Formula verification:**\n- `gh_d = ((2.497 * ca_mg_l) + (4.118 * mg_mg_l)) / 17.848` ✓ (line 79)\n- `kh_d = (alkalinity_meq_l * 50.0) / 17.848` ✓ (line 80)\n- `tds_mg_l = total_tracked_ions_mg / volume_l` ✓ (line 77)\n- `conductivity_us_cm = tds_mg_l / 0.65` ✓ (line 78)\n\n---\n\n## Summary\n\nAll 12 required simulation systems are implemented with scientifically grounded formulas and logic:\n\n| System | File Path | Status |\n|--------|-----------|--------|\n| 1. Temperature (ua_total, q_ambient, q_heater deadband, heat_capacity) | `/root/tank-simulation/crates/tank_core/src/systems/temperature.rs` | ✓ VERIFIED |\n| 2. Nitrogen Cycle (detritus→mineralization→TAN→NO₂→NO₃, Monod rates) | `/root/tank-simulation/crates/tank_core/src/systems/nitrogen_cycle.rs` | ✓ VERIFIED |\n| 3. Ammonia Speciation (pKa, fraction_NH3) | `/root/tank-simulation/crates/tank_core/src/systems/chemistry.rs` | ✓ VERIFIED |\n| 4. Dissolved Oxygen (saturation table, reaeration, photosynthesis/respiration) | `/root/tank-simulation/crates/tank_core/src/systems/dissolved_oxygen.rs` | ✓ VERIFIED |\n| 5. pH & Alkalinity (pH formula, 0.1428 meq/mg N consumption) | `/root/tank-simulation/crates/tank_core/src/systems/chemistry.rs` + process.rs | ✓ VERIFIED |\n| 6. Substrate (1-3 layers, InertSand/Gravel/ActivePlanted/CoarsePorous) | `/root/tank-simulation/crates/tank_core/src/types/substrate.rs` | ✓ VERIFIED |\n| 7. Plant Guilds (FastStem & RootFeedingRosette, bounded growth) | `/root/tank-simulation/crates/tank_core/src/systems/plant_growth.rs` | ✓ VERIFIED |\n| 8. Algae/Periphyton (suspended + periphyton pools, light/nutrient/shading) | `/root/tank-simulation/crates/tank_core/src/systems/algae_growth.rs` | ✓ VERIFIED |\n| 9. Decomposer/Nitrifier Guilds (AOB, NOB, comammox, Monod kinetics) | `/root/tank-simulation/crates/tank_core/src/systems/nitrogen_cycle.rs` | ✓ VERIFIED |\n| 10. Microfauna (grazing index, population dynamics) | `/root/tank-simulation/crates/tank_core/src/systems/microfauna.rs` | ✓ VERIFIED |\n| 11. Shrimp (adults/juveniles/berried females, condition/molt/reproductive traits) | `/root/tank-simulation/crates/tank_core/src/systems/shrimp.rs` | ✓ VERIFIED |\n| 12. Display Formulas (gh_d, kh_d, tds_mg_l, conductivity_us_cm) | `/root/tank-simulation/crates/tank_core/src/types/snapshot.rs` | ✓ VERIFIED |\n\nAll formulas match the specification with exact coefficient values and mathematical relationships confir