{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_01Ww7yBvLENLhtoREEgaNw7K","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01UCaXNtFgAXHKM8s79niZTb","name":"Agent","input":{"description":"Check save/load, update order, invariants","subagent_type":"Explore","prompt":"In /root/tank-simulation, verify these specific requirements very thoroughly:\n\n1. SAVE FORMAT: Check save.rs - does the JSON save format include: schema_version, app_version, full TankState, queued_actions, RNG state?\n\n2. UPDATE ORDER: Check engine.rs - verify the hourly pipeline follows this exact order:\n   (1) apply queued actions, (2) update volume for water changes, (3) mix source water, (4) temperature, (5) light state, (6) feed/excretion, (7) decomposition/mineralization, (8) nitrification, (9) DIC/alkalinity/pH, (10) dissolved oxygen, (11) plant/periphyton photosynthesis, (12) shrimp stress, (13) events, (14) derived observables\n   And the daily pipeline: (1) plant growth, (2) algae/periphyton, (3) microfauna, (4) shrimp condition/reproduction/mortality, (5) biofilter maturity, (6) stability\n\n3. INVARIANTS: Check invariants.rs - are these enforced after every update?\n   - no negative mass pools\n   - no negative populations\n   - 0.0 <= index <= 1.0 for health/maturity/stress\n   - temperature above 0.0 C\n\n4. DISSOLVED POOLS: Check water.rs - are ALL these tracked as total amounts?\n   - ammonia_total_mg_n_total (TAN)\n   - nitrite_mg_n_total\n   - nitrate_mg_n_total\n   - phosphate_mg_p_total\n   - dissolved_oxygen_mg_total\n   - dissolved_inorganic_carbon_mg_c_total\n   - dissolved_organic_carbon_mg_c_total\n   - dissolved_organic_nitrogen_mg_n_total\n   - alkalinity_meq_total\n   - ions: Ca, Mg, Na, K, HCO3, Cl, SO4 as total mg\n\n5. EVENT RETENTION: Are at least 200 events kept in state and 20 in snapshot?\n\n6. OPEN_TOP: Does open_top=false reduce surface exchange by a configurable multiplier defaulting to 0.25?\n\nReport every finding with file paths and line numbers."},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":673,"cache_read_input_tokens":37663,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":673},"output_tokens":2,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"5afc8472-1402-44b3-9d7c-1a241eb51364","uuid":"2d5f6c48-dec3-47e5-81a3-e9c592a7f30b"}
