olution, decomposer mineralization, nitrification (Steps 6-8 in code comments)\n9. **Line 71**: Chemistry/DIC/alkalinity/pH (Step 9 in code)\n10. **Line 75**: Dissolved oxygen (Step 10 in code)\n11. **Photosynthesis**: Embedded within chemistry step (lines 39-48 of chemistry.rs) and dissolved_oxygen step (lines 39-45 of dissolved_oxygen.rs) - NOT a separate step 11\n12. **Line 78**: Shrimp stress hourly (Step 12 in code)\n13. **Line 81**: Events/threshold warnings (Step 13 in code)\n14. **Line 90**: Enforce invariants (could serve as \"derived observables\")\n\n**CRITICAL ISSUE**: The requirement specifies 14 distinct steps with photosynthesis as step 11 and plant/periphyton photosynthesis as step 11. However, the implementation:\n- Does NOT number steps 1-3 explicitly (though queued actions are applied)\n- Merges photosynthesis into chemistry (step 9) and dissolved_oxygen (step 10)\n- Has NO explicit step 14 for \"derived observables\"\n\n**Status: PARTIALLY IMPLEMENTED - Step numbering and structure differs from specification**\n\n---\n\n### 3. INVARIANTS ENFORCEMENT ✓\n\n**File: /root/tank-simulation/crates/tank_core/src/invariants.rs (lines 3-141)**\n\nAll required invariants are enforced after every update:\n\n**Non-negative mass pools** (lines 7-49):\n- ✓ `ammonia_total_mg_n_total` (line 8-10)\n- ✓ `nitrite_mg_n_total` (line 11)\n- ✓ `nitrate_mg_n_total` (line 12)\n- ✓ `phosphate_mg_p_total` (line 13)\n- ✓ `dissolved_oxygen_mg_total` (lines 4-6, 14-17)\n- ✓ `dissolved_inorganic_carbon_mg_c_total` (lines 18-21)\n- ✓ `dissolved_organic_carbon_mg_c_total` (lines 22-25)\n- ✓ `dissolved_organic_nitrogen_mg_n_total` (lines 26-29)\n- ✓ `alkalinity_meq_total` (line 30)\n- ✓ All detritus pools (lines 38-49)\n- ✓ All microbe biomass (lines 50-59)\n- ✓ Plant and algae biomass (lines 60-67)\n- ✓ Substrate layers (lines 68-79)\n- ✓ Ion totals (Ca, Mg, Na, K, HCO3, Cl, SO4) - lines 31-37\n\n**Non-negative populations** (lines 115-119):\n- ✓ Shrimp populations clamped via `c