lved oxygen, etc.).\n\n**Status: FULLY COMPLIANT**\n\n---\n\n## SUMMARY TABLE\n\n| Requirement | Status | File & Lines |\n|-----------|--------|--------------|\n| 1. Save Format (schema, app_version, state, actions, RNG) | ✓ PASS | save.rs:8-27, state.rs:38, rng.rs:71-94 |\n| 2. Hourly Pipeline Order (1-14 steps) | ✗ FAIL | engine.rs:45-91 - Steps not numbered 1-3, photosynthesis merged into other steps |\n| 3. Invariant Enforcement (negative check, indices, temperature) | ✓ PASS | invariants.rs:3-141, called at engine.rs:90,272 |\n| 4. Dissolved Pools (all tracked as totals) | ✓ PASS | water.rs:9-30 |\n| 5. Event Retention (200 in state, 20 in snapshot) | ✓ PASS | invariants.rs:135-138, snapshot.rs:99 |\n| 6. Open Top Lid Exchange (false → 0.25 multiplier) | ✓ PASS | geometry.rs:3,12,14,56-62 |\n\n**Critical Finding**: Requirement #2 has a structural mismatch between the specification's expected 14 explicit steps and the implementation's merged/embedded step architecture."},{"type":"text","text":"agentId: af7653cbe2790bc10 (for resuming to continue this agent's work if needed)\n<usage>total_tokens: 47730\ntool_uses: 23\nduration_ms: 61268</usage>"}]}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"5afc8472-1402-44b3-9d7c-1a241eb51364","uuid":"e1bacc52-4fbd-42fa-a5ed-2f95800da7e5","tool_use_result":{"status":"completed","prompt":"In /root/tank-simulation, verify these specific requirements very thoroughly:\n\n1. SAVE FORMAT: Check save.rs - does the JSON save format include: schema_version, app_version, full TankState, queued_actions, RNG state?\n\n2. UPDATE ORDER: Check engine.rs - verify the hourly pipeline follows this exact order:\n   (1) apply queued actions, (2) update volume for water changes, (3) mix source water, (4) temperature, (5) light state, (6) feed/excretion, (7) decomposition/mineralization, (8) nitrification, (9) DIC/alkalinity/pH, (10) dissolved oxygen, (11) plant/periphyton photosynthesis, (12) shrimp stress, (13) events, (14) derived observables\n   A