op: bool,                          // Line 12\n    #[serde(default = \"default_lid_exchange_factor\")]\n    pub lid_exchange_factor: f64,                // Line 14 - configurable multiplier\n}\n\npub fn top_exchange_factor(&self) -> f64 {\n    if self.open_top {\n        1.0                                      // Full exchange when open\n    } else {\n        self.lid_exchange_factor.clamp(0.0, 1.0) // Reduced exchange when closed\n    }\n}\n\nimpl Default for TankGeometry {\n    fn default() -> Self {\n        Self {\n            open_top: true,                       // Default is open\n            lid_exchange_factor: DEFAULT_LID_EXCHANGE_FACTOR,  // 0.25\n        }\n    }\n}\n```\n\nVerification: The `top_exchange_factor()` method (lines 56-62) returns:\n- `1.0` when `open_top = true`\n- `lid_exchange_factor` (default 0.25) when `open_top = false`\n\nThis factor is used to reduce surface exchange calculations throughout the systems (e.g., in temperature, dissolved oxygen, etc.).\n\n**Status: FULLY COMPLIANT**\n\n---\n\n## SUMMARY TABLE\n\n| Requirement | Status | File & Lines |\n|-----------|--------|--------------|\n| 1. Save Format (schema, app_version, state, actions, RNG) | ✓ PASS | save.rs:8-27, state.rs:38, rng.rs:71-94 |\n| 2. Hourly Pipeline Order (1-14 steps) | ✗ FAIL | engine.rs:45-91 - Steps not numbered 1-3, photosynthesis merged into other steps |\n| 3. Invariant Enforcement (negative check, indices, temperature) | ✓ PASS | invariants.rs:3-141, called at engine.rs:90,272 |\n| 4. Dissolved Pools (all tracked as totals) | ✓ PASS | water.rs:9-30 |\n| 5. Event Retention (200 in state, 20 in snapshot) | ✓ PASS | invariants.rs:135-138, snapshot.rs:99 |\n| 6. Open Top Lid Exchange (false → 0.25 multiplier) | ✓ PASS | geometry.rs:3,12,14,56-62 |\n\n**Critical Finding**: Requirement #2 has a structural mismatch between the specification's expected 14 explicit steps and the implementation's merged/embedded step architecture."}],"totalDurationMs":61268,"totalT